  "spec": {
    "annotations": [
      {
        "kind": "AnnotationQuery",
        "spec": {
          "query": {
            "kind": "DataQuery",
            "group": "grafana",
            "version": "v0",
            "spec": {}
          },
          "enable": true,
          "hide": true,
          "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
          "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
          "builtIn": true
        }
      }
    ],
    "cursorSync": "Off",
    "description": "Alloy network-fork architecture (SNMP / traps / syslog / netflow).",
    "editable": true,
    "elements": {
      "panel-1": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 1,
          "title": "Purpose & audience",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.1.0-27822252871",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## Alloy network \u2192 Grafana Cloud\n\nThese dashboards read the **Alloy network addons** (SNMP + traps + syslog + flow).\n\n**What you get when it works:**\n- SNMP as curated `snmp_*` (`job=\"alloy-snmp\"`, label `snmp_group`)\n- Interface counters are Prometheus **counters** \u2014 `rate(snmp_ifHCInOctets[$__rate_interval]) * 8` or recording rule `if:snmp_ifHCInOctets:rate5m * 8`\n- Flow as `alloy_network_io_by_flow_bytes{integration=\"alloy-netflow\"}` \u2014 use **`rate()` / `increase()`**\n- Traps as Loki `{service_name=\"alloy-snmptrap\"}` (JSON; group by `trap_oid`)\n- Syslog as Loki `{service_name=\"alloy-syslog\"}` (plain text; `severity` is a label)\n\n**Docs:** [alloy-network-fork.md](https://github.com/Mesverrum/grafana-network-o11y-guide/blob/main/docs/architecture.md) \u00b7 fork [Mesverrum/alloy `network-snmp`](https://github.com/Mesverrum/alloy/tree/network-snmp) \u00b7 discovery [Mesverrum/snmp-sd](https://github.com/Mesverrum/snmp-sd)\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 2,
          "title": "Architecture (reference)",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.1.0-27822252871",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## End-to-end data path\n\n```\nNetwork devices Alloy (hostNetwork)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSNMP :161 \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25ba prometheus.exporter.snmp\n discovery.snmp (snmp-sd fingerprinters)\n hot 60s / cold 5m\nTraps :1620 otelcol.receiver.snmptrap\nSyslog :1514 otelcol.receiver.syslog (protocol=none)\nNetFlow :2055 / sFlow :6344 otelcol.receiver.netflow \u2192 signaltometrics\n Alloy OTLP HTTP \u2500\u2500\u25ba Grafana Cloud\n```\n\nThis lab's Alloy also listens on `:11620` / `:1515` when another collector already owns `:1620` / `:1514`.\n\n**Identity:** `device_name` from the SNMP catalog. Group label is **`snmp_group`** (hq / branch1 / branch2).\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-3": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 3,
          "title": "Docker Compose services",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.1.0-27822252871",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## Collectors (Alloy path)\n\n| Signal | Component | Parallel listen | How to query |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| SNMP | `prometheus.exporter.snmp` + `discovery.snmp` | scrape :161 | `snmp_CPU{job=\"alloy-snmp\"}` |\n| Traps | `otelcol.receiver.snmptrap` | `:11620` | `{service_name=\"alloy-snmptrap\"}` |\n| Syslog | `otelcol.receiver.syslog` | `:1515` | `{service_name=\"alloy-syslog\"}` |\n| NetFlow / sFlow | `otelcol.receiver.netflow` | `:2055` / `:6344` | `rate(alloy_network_io_by_flow_bytes{integration=\"alloy-netflow\"}[5m])` |\n\nComposites: Grafana-managed recording rules `device:snmp_MemoryUtilization:percent`, `if:snmp_ifHCInOctets:rate5m` (octets/s \u2014 multiply by 8 for bps).\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-4": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 4,
          "title": "Deployment model (credential groups)",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.1.0-27822252871",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## Discovery groups\n\nAlloy discovery is Prometheus-shaped: named **`auth`** + SuperQ fingerprinters \u2192 module list.\n\n| Example `snmp_group` | What it is |\n|---|---|\n| `hq` | One discovery job / site (your names) |\n| `branch1` | Another CIDR or credential set |\n\nTiers: **hot** (60s \u2014 CPU/mem/octets/oper), **cold** (5m \u2014 names, errors, packet counters, IP inventory). BGP flaps are traps/syslog, not a poll interval.\n\nCredentials stay on the collector (`SNMP_AUTHS` / `auths_file`), not in Fleet text.\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-5": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 5,
          "title": "Metrics you should see",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.1.0-27822252871",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## Proof queries (this stack)\n\n```promql\ncount by (device_name) (snmp_CPU{job=\"alloy-snmp\"})\ncount by (snmp_group) (snmp_CPU{job=\"alloy-snmp\"})\nrate(snmp_ifHCInOctets{job=\"alloy-snmp\"}[$__rate_interval]) * 8\nif:snmp_ifHCInOctets:rate5m * 8\nrate(alloy_network_io_by_flow_bytes{integration=\"alloy-netflow\"}[5m]) * 8\nup{job=\"alloy-snmp\",snmp_tier=\"hot\"}\n```\n\n```logql\n{service_name=\"alloy-snmptrap\"}\n{service_name=\"alloy-syslog\"}\n```\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
