            "version": "13.1.0-27822252871",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## Site rollout checklist\n\n1. Alloy is scraping SNMP (`up{job=\"alloy-snmp\",snmp_tier=\"hot\"}`)\n2. Traps reach Alloy (`:1620`, or `:11620` if that port is already taken)\n3. Syslog reaches Alloy (`:1514`, or `:1515` alias)\n4. Softflowd / sFlow exporters point at Alloy `:2055` / `:6344`\n5. Explore: `count by (device_name) (snmp_CPU{job=\"alloy-snmp\"})` matches inventory\n6. Recording rules: `if:snmp_ifHCInOctets:rate5m` (may take ~1\u20135m after provision)\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-8": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 8,
          "title": "Verification queries",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.1.0-27822252871",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## Explore snippets\n\n**SNMP inventory**\n`count by (device_name, snmp_group) (snmp_CPU{job=\"alloy-snmp\"})`\n\n**Hot scrape up**\n`up{job=\"alloy-snmp\",snmp_tier=\"hot\"}`\n\n**Interface bps (counters)**\n`rate(snmp_ifHCInOctets{job=\"alloy-snmp\",device_name=~\"$device\"}[$__rate_interval]) * 8`\n\n**Flow**\n`count(alloy_network_io_by_flow_bytes{integration=\"alloy-netflow\"})`\n\n**Traps / syslog**\n`{service_name=\"alloy-snmptrap\"}` \u00b7 `{service_name=\"alloy-syslog\"}`\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-9": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 9,
          "title": "Troubleshooting & references",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
