          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.1.0-27822252871",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## If panels are empty\n\n- Device dropdown + `$__all`: pick `snmp_group=hq` (or any concrete group). `allValue` should be `.*`.\n- Wrong metric family: this folder is `snmp_*` / `alloy_*`.\n- Interface bps still empty after ~2m: recording rules `if:snmp_ifHCInOctets:rate5m` evaluate every 60s; fallback is `rate(snmp_ifHCInOctets[$__rate_interval])*8`.\n- Health queue-style panels are Alloy scrape / component metrics.\n\n**References:** [docs/alloy-network-fork.md](https://github.com/Mesverrum/grafana-network-o11y-guide/blob/main/docs/architecture.md) \u00b7 [Mesverrum/alloy network-snmp](https://github.com/Mesverrum/alloy/tree/network-snmp) \u00b7 [snmp-sd](https://github.com/Mesverrum/snmp-sd)\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
